   <text:h text:style-name="P2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="sweat-with-moringa"/><text:soft-page-break/>Sweat with Moringa</text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="bringing-the-miracle-tree-moringa--hot-bath-therapy-nationwide"/>Bringing &quot;The Miracle Tree&quot; Moringa × Hot Bath Therapy Nationwide</text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="experience-moringa-steaming-at-your-salon"/>Experience Moringa Steaming at Your Salon</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://moringa-steam.com/news/" office:target-frame-name="_blank" xlink:show="new" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="T1">News List</text:span></text:a></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L1">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P11">2019.09.03 <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://moringa-steam.com/news/20190903/" office:target-frame-name="_blank" xlink:show="new" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Opening Moringa Steam Therapist® Training &amp; Business School</text:span></text:a></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Horizontal_20_Line"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="the-miracle-tree---moringa"/>&quot;The Miracle Tree&quot; - Moringa</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">Moringa (Moringa Oleifera) is a plant native to subtropical regions that contains over 90 essential nutrients in a well-balanced manner. It is also called the &quot;Miracle Tree,&quot; &quot;Tree of Life,&quot; and &quot;Medicine Box Tree,&quot; and is the ultimate superfood left to humanity to supplement modern nutritional deficiencies.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">The ancient Indian medical text &quot;Ayurveda&quot; states that it is effective in preventing over 300 types of diseases. Useful components are contained in all parts of the plant: leaves, flowers, pods, seeds, bark, and stems.</text:p>
