     </draw:image>
     <svg:title>Representative Director Mai Mizuguchi</svg:title>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="spreading-the-power-of-the-miracle-tree-moringa--hot-bath-therapy-nationwide"/>Spreading the Power of &quot;The Miracle Tree&quot; Moringa × Hot Bath Therapy Nationwide</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">I am Mizuguchi, the Representative Director of the Japan Moringa Steaming Association.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">Although the superfood &quot;Moringa&quot; has gradually become known in Japan in recent years, I became captivated by its charm even before it became famous and went to study in America and the Philippines.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:soft-page-break/>I want to spread nationwide the message that it is necessary in modern society to absorb Moringa&apos;s nutrition not only internally but also externally.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">Furthermore, I chose the association format because I wanted to energize the entire industry through Moringa steaming by connecting with salon owners who previously had almost no horizontal connections.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">If you would like to experience Moringa steaming, please contact our certified salons nationwide.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">We are still recruiting salons for introduction.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">Let&apos;s expand the circle of Moringa together!</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Horizontal_20_Line"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="what-is-moringa-steaming"/>What is Moringa Steaming?</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">Moringa steaming is a hot bath therapy using steam from steamed leaves of the &quot;Miracle Tree&quot; Moringa. In contrast to its aromatic green tea-like scent that creates a relaxed and calm atmosphere, you can experience amazing effects in less than 5 minutes: sweat pouring from your pores, incredible detoxification, skincare benefits, diet support, relief from gynecological concerns, fertility support, and increased basal body temperature.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">Moringa steaming is recommended for everyone who wants to improve their constitution, but our association&apos;s original Moringa steaming menu &quot;JMSA Moringa Steam®&quot; is especially recommended for the following people:</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="1-for-those-trying-to-conceive"/>1. For Those Trying to Conceive</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">While mugwort steaming is famous for fertility support, it can actually only be offered for half the month to those trying to conceive. Moringa steaming can be safely offered anytime - even during pregnancy. Some clients have come for warming treatments until the day before delivery! ♪</text:p>
