   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="2-for-those-with-hay-fever-or-atopy"/>2. For Those with Hay Fever or Atopy</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">The most common feedback from customers who have continued Moringa steaming for several years is: &quot;I feel like my hay fever symptoms have eased compared to last year!&quot; You can detox thoroughly and achieve smooth, beautiful skin. It&apos;s also popular among those with atopy.</text:p>
