   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="3-diet-support"/><text:soft-page-break/>3. Diet Support</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">Although you&apos;re just sitting during Moringa steaming, you can actually burn calories equivalent to 3 hours of aerobics. If you&apos;re troubled by swelling, please try it right away. The amino acid power contained in Moringa may also help?!</text:p>
