   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="better-than-any-herb-ive-tried-before"/>Better than any herb I&apos;ve tried before!!</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">This is amazing! Even though my body was cold, I immediately broke into a heavy sweat, and after about 20-30 minutes, my skin started to become smooth. Even after finishing, the sweat wouldn&apos;t stop and changing clothes was difficult (laughs). Better than any herb I&apos;ve tried before!!</text:p>
