   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="i-sweated-profusely"/>I sweated profusely!</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">My first Moringa steam! I sweated profusely! My hands and feet are warm! My body feels refreshed and light ♪</text:p>
