     <svg:title>Testimonial 3</svg:title>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="i-want-to-try-it-again"/><text:soft-page-break/>I want to try it again</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">I experienced Moringa for the first time, and my whole body was warm, and my circulation and facial swelling were refreshed! I want to try it again ♪</text:p>
