   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="feeling-refreshed-and-slimmer"/>Feeling refreshed and slimmer!</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">Dripping with sweat, I feel refreshed and slimmer. I&apos;ve been cleansed from the inside out.</text:p>
