     <svg:title>Testimonial 5</svg:title>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="really-refreshed"/><text:soft-page-break/>Really refreshed</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">I sweated profusely. But after finishing, it felt smooth and there was no unpleasant feeling at all. The lingering scent doesn&apos;t bother me either. I&apos;m really refreshed!!</text:p>
