   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="smooth-sweat-and-silky-skin"/>Smooth sweat and silky skin</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">I thought there might be discomfort after wiping the sweat... but there was none at all! Sweat came out from my head and entire body!</text:p>
