     <svg:title>Testimonial 7</svg:title>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="safe-and-enjoyable-even-during-pregnancy"/>Safe and enjoyable even during pregnancy</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">I heard it&apos;s safe for pregnant women and wanted to try steaming. Currently 8 months pregnant, I have severe swelling, cold feet, and leg cramps, so I&apos;m looking forward to future sessions! Right now, my whole body is warm, like after a bath.</text:p>
