     <svg:title>Testimonial 9</svg:title>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="felt-relaxed-and-refreshed"/>Felt relaxed and refreshed</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">A few minutes after starting, while relaxing with my eyes closed, large drops of sweat suddenly began flowing non-stop, and even after finishing, the sweat continued for a while. I felt relaxed and refreshed! Clean and refreshing!! Highly recommended</text:p>
