     <svg:title>Testimonial 10</svg:title>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="felt-incredibly-detoxed"/>Felt incredibly detoxed</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">I was soothed by the fresh green scent. The fragrance gradually became gentler. I started sweating earlier than with mugwort steaming. Even after finishing, the sweat wouldn&apos;t stop, and I feel incredibly detoxed.</text:p>
