     <svg:title>Testimonial 11</svg:title>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark text:name="sweated-heavily-today"/>Sweated heavily today</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">I sweated more than usual. Sometimes my face doesn&apos;t sweat, but today I sweated heavily.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Horizontal_20_Line"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="introduction-to-certified-salons"/>Introduction to Certified Salons</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">Our association&apos;s Moringa steaming can be experienced at certified esthetic salons, relaxation salons, chiropractic clinics, and acupuncture clinics nationwide. Please find a store near you.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">(Some salons are still being prepared for listing. If there are no nearby stores, please contact us.)</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P9">Certified Salon Gallery:</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L2">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P12">aesthetic salon Laguna</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P12">Lymph &amp; Detox Salon Lu・cuore</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P12">Esthetic Salon Celestia</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P12">Total Healthcare salon Nilufa</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P12">Yomogi &amp; Moringa Steam Warming Salon Ananta</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P12">Organic &amp; Detox salon Beloved</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P12">EMIE</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">Furthermore, our association&apos;s direct &quot;JMSA Moringa Steam®&quot; can be experienced at salons with Moringa Steam Therapists®.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:soft-page-break/>If you&apos;re aiming for constitutional improvement, please contact salons with Moringa Steam Therapists®.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://moringa-steam.com/salon/" office:target-frame-name="_blank" xlink:show="new" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Introduction to Nationwide Certified Salons</text:span></text:a></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Horizontal_20_Line"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="for-those-considering-introducing-moringa-steaming"/>For Those Considering Introducing Moringa Steaming</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">Fortunately, in recent years, awareness of Moringa steaming has increased in the industry, and it has become easier to obtain Moringa as a seat bath agent than before.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">However, learning at our association, which started Moringa steaming for the first time in Japan, and introducing Moringa steaming ensures overwhelming specialized knowledge and continuous after-sales support. Above all, we provide food-grade Moringa leaves that have obtained organic certifications both domestically and internationally, so we guarantee that you can confidently offer it to your customers.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">We have prepared four courses optimal for your purpose, from courses that can be easily introduced to business opening schools.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="http://moringa-steam.com/school/" office:target-frame-name="_blank" xlink:show="new" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="T1">About Introduction &amp; Business Opening School</text:span></text:a></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Horizontal_20_Line"/>
